### Run "Login: happy path"

### My bars
GET http://localhost:8080/bars
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### One bar
GET http://localhost:8080/bars/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### One bar's tables
GET http://localhost:8080/bars/1/tables
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Add a bar
POST http://localhost:8080/bars
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "barName": "New Spot",
  "address": "9 Rack Rd"
}

### Update a bar
PUT http://localhost:8080/bars/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "barName": "Carmelos (renamed)",
  "address": "1234 Main St"
}

### Delete a bar
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bars/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Bar id that isn't yours  403 / 404
GET http://localhost:8080/bars/999/tables
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Add a table to bar 1
POST http://localhost:8080/bars/1/tables
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "maxPlayers": 4,
  "closingTime": "23:30"
}

### Update table 1 at bar 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/bars/1/tables/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "maxPlayers": 6,
  "closingTime": "22:00"
}

### Delete table 1 at bar 1
DELETE http://localhost:8080/bars/1/tables/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Table that isn't at this bar  404
PUT http://localhost:8080/bars/1/tables/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "maxPlayers": 6,
  "closingTime": "22:00"
}
